      "options": {
        "content": "\nThis folder has one audience test: **can an operator identify the failing layer and the exact node/link/job without reading raw logs?**\n\n[GPU ECC & Row Remap](/d/iren16k-ova-ecc) \u00b7 [GPU XID Incidents](/d/iren16k-ova-xid) \u00b7 [GPU Thermals & Power](/d/iren16k-ova-gpu-thermals) \u00b7 [Slurm Node Health](/d/iren16k-ova-node-health) \u00b7 [Switch Congestion](/d/iren16k-ova-congestion) \u00b7 [Host HCA Health](/d/iren16k-ova-host-hca) \u00b7 [Validation & HLT](/d/iren16k-ova-validation) \u00b7 [Job Flight Recorder](/d/iren16k-ova-job-flight-recorder) \u00b7 [BMC / iDRAC Audit](/d/iren16k-ova-bmc) \u00b7 [Telemetry Coverage](/d/iren16k-ova-telemetry)\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Start here",
      "type": "text"
    },
